revisionDesc.change:
Submit - Reexamination of the text from picture and original (minor readings, mostly) :
l. 4 I moved the bracket, missing in the ed. pr. and wrongly added afterwards (not explained in apparatus as it’s just a typo mistake);
l. 9, 10, 17 : some letters put out of brackets and doted;
l. 11: κ undoted (very clear); the dot wasn’t in the ed. pr.;
l. 24 [ἔρρω]σο: [ἔρρωσ]ο̣ or maybe better [ἔρ]ρ̣(ωσο): The σ is clearly absent. And the writer uses to shift the salutation line to the right, which wouldn't really leave room for the entire ἔρρωσο.
